))</rend></td></tr></table></annot><annot startid="#m-f5729062-144a-4353-b4ff-c5da894a8eef" endid="#m-fde002bd-fe88-4227-ae9d-e37d71a239da"><table><tr><td><rend>((horgana))</rend></td><td><rend>]</rend></td><td><rend>lies ((organa))</rend></td></tr></table></annot><annot startid="#m-c5ebd085-1682-448e-b589-e559791dbb98" endid="#m-38b511cf-d137-4ae1-95fd-26f64f67c7c6" corresp="#m-comment-5"><table><tr><td><ptr target="#m-comment-5-notes-0"/></td><td><rend>]</rend></td><td><rend>Notation ungenau, dem Eindruck nach wie Lesart</rend></td><td><ptr target="#m-comment-5-notes-1"/></td><td><rend>(alles Folgende eine Stufe höher); die Edition orientiert sich an 4a und ((Pa 1871-93-1)).</rend></td></tr></table></annot><annot startid="#m-bd7b6c94-d8a2-4ebe-97f6-db5fc8033e1a" endid="#m-fde002bd-fe88-4227-ae9d-e37d71a239da" corresp="#m-comment-6"><table><tr><td><ptr target="#m-comment-6-notes-0"/></td><td><rend>]</rend></td><td><rend>Notation ungenau, dem Eindruck nach</rend></td><td><ptr target="#m-comment-6-notes-1"/></td><td><rend>(alles Folgende eine Stufe höher); die Edition orientiert sich an 5b und ((Pa 1871-93-1)).</rend></td></tr></table></annot><annot startid="#m-4f7a9934-fa59-45a9-a4e5-202f940485e2" endid="#m-4f7a9934-fa59-45a9-a4e5-202f940485e2" corresp="#m-comment-7"><table><tr><td><ptr target="#m-comment-7-notes-0"/></td><td><rend>]</rend></td><td><rend>Notation ungenau, dem Eindruck nach</rend></td><td><ptr target="#m-comment-7-notes-1"/></td><td><rend>, die Edition orientiert sich an 5a.</rend></td></tr></table></annot><annot startid="#m-06284200-6fbf-4a5c-afb1-2aa96382958a" endid="#m-99fed8e3-1794-4dc3-9b85-682bdc2ff955"><table><tr><td><rend>((hominum))</rend></td><td><rend>]</rend></td><td><rend>korrigiert aus ((ominum))</rend></td></tr></table></annot><annot startid="#m-3c03214c-3d32-416f-bae6-bcc587c04d38" endid="#m-3a60962e-30e5-42b0-8511-1fbdba6d12f4" type="emendation"><table><tr><td><rend>((pacatissima))</rend></td><td><rend>]</rend></td><td><rend>((peccat